        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">A Precor treadmill is a club machine, and in 2026 a home buyer
          will almost always be buying a used or remanufactured one.</strong> Peloton still owns
          Precor, Precor sells no home treadmill, and its current TRM lines are sold to facilities
          without public prices — but the brand's sheer numbers make second-hand Precors easy to
          find, service and value.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Check for a dedicated 20-amp circuit first, identify the exact generation from the serial
          label, run the incline through its full range, and prefer a remanufactured unit with a
          written parts and on-site labour warranty, since Precor's own cover does not pass to a
          second owner. Start with our
          <a href="/used-treadmill-buying-checklist/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">used treadmill checklist</a>
          and <a href="/gym-treadmill-for-home/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">gym treadmill for home guide</a>.
